<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA, AUSTRALIA 378-4 TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA, AUSTRALIA 378-4 TEA.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 378 for four at tea on the third day of the first test against South Africa at the Wanderers on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 302, Australia 378-4 (Matthew Elliot 85, Greg Blewitt 103 not out, Steve Waugh 93 not out).</p>
